sequenceDiagram
    %% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% PHASE 1: INITIAL AUTHENTICATION (OAuth 2.0 PKCE)
    %% ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    
    autonumber
    
    participant Dev as 👤 Developer
    participant Chat as Copilot Chat
    participant LLM as GitHub Copilot<br/>(LLM)
    participant MCP as MCP Client
    participant Ext as Auth Extension
    participant TM as TokenManager
    participant KCH as OS Keychain
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Ping as PingFederate

    Note over Dev,Ping: Phase 1: Initial Authentication (First Time Login)
    
    Dev->>Chat: "List topics on prod"
    Chat->>LLM: Send prompt to LLM
    LLM->>LLM: Parse intent<br/>Tool: list_topics<br/>Env: prod
    LLM->>MCP: Tool call request
    
    MCP->>Ext: getSession(scopes)
    Ext->>TM: getAccessToken()
    
    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
        Note over TM,KCH: Check existing tokens
        TM->>TM: Check memory cache
        Note right of TM: _accessToken = null
        TM->>KCH: Retrieve refresh_token
        KCH-->>TM: null (first login)
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over TM,Ping: OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code + PKCE
        
        TM->>TM: Generate PKCE pair
        Note right of TM: code_verifier = random(43-128 chars)<br/>code_challenge = base64url(SHA256(verifier))
        
        TM->>Browser: Open authorization URL
        Note over Browser: GET /as/authorization.oauth2<br/>?response_type=code<br/>&client_id=mcp-vscode<br/>&redirect_uri=vscode://mcp-auth<br/>&scope=openid email offline_access<br/>&code_challenge={challenge}<br/>&code_challenge_method=S256
        
        Browser->>Ping: Authorization request
        Ping-->>Browser: Login page
        
        Browser->>Dev: Show login form
        Dev->>Browser: Enter username + password
        Browser->>Ping: Submit credentials
        
        Ping->>Ping: Validate credentials
        
        alt MFA Required
            Ping-->>Browser: MFA challenge
            Browser->>Dev: Show MFA prompt
            Dev->>Browser: Enter OTP/Push approve
            Browser->>Ping: Submit MFA
            Ping->>Ping: Validate MFA
        end
        
        Ping->>Ping: Generate authorization_code
        Ping-->>Browser: Redirect to vscode://mcp-auth?code={auth_code}
        Browser->>Ext: URI callback with code
    end
    
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Ext,Ping: Token Exchange
        
        Ext->>TM: Exchange code for tokens
        TM->>Ping: POST /as/token.oauth2
        Note over TM,Ping: grant_type=authorization_code<br/>code={auth_code}<br/>code_verifier={verifier}<br/>client_id=mcp-vscode<br/>redirect_uri=vscode://mcp-auth
        
        Ping->>Ping: Verify code_verifier matches challenge
        Ping->>Ping: Generate tokens
        
        Ping-->>TM: Token Response
        Note over Ping,TM: {<br/>  access_token: "eyJhbG...",<br/>  refresh_token: "dGhpcy...",<br/>  token_type: "Bearer",<br/>  expires_in: 3600<br/>}
    end
    
    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over TM,KCH: Store Tokens Securely
        
        TM->>TM: Store in memory
        Note right of TM: _accessToken = token<br/>_expiresAt = now + 3600s
        
        TM->>KCH: Store refresh_token (encrypted)
        KCH-->>TM: Stored ✓
        
        TM->>TM: Schedule refresh timer
        Note right of TM: setTimeout(refresh, 50 min)
    end
    
    TM-->>Ext: Return access_token
    Ext->>Ext: Update status bar ✅
    Ext-->>MCP: AuthSession
    Note over MCP: Ready for API calls
    
    Note over Dev,Ping: ⏱️ Total Duration: 3-10 seconds (depends on MFA)
